oints\u003C\u002Fspan>, redeemable for gifts in our store.","Welcome to AtomGit! Jump in and let's get you up to speed！","Love this repo? Light up a \u003Cspan class='text-primary-red'>Star\u003C\u002Fspan> to cheer the author on!","Star","Begin your open-source journey on AtomGit by creating or migrating \u003Cspan class='text-primary-red'>your first repo\u003C\u002Fspan>.","Create Project","Master platform features through tasks, earn points, and redeem gifts in the Mall.","Growth Center","Fun growth play—light up your exclusive open-source achievements.","Congratulations! You've completed the guide. \u003Cspan class='text-points-primary'>20 points\u003C\u002Fspan> have been awarded.","Use \u003Cstrong>Clone\u003C\u002Fstrong> to copy the repository to your machine, or \u003Cstrong>Download\u003C\u002Fstrong> a ZIP to browse the code quickly.","Search",{"privacy":1146,"private":1146,"public":1147},"Private","Public","Participants","Reset","Retry","Save","Settings",{"read":1154,"title":1155},"Read","Status","Task Type","Thank You for Your Feedback!",{"daysAgo":1159,"hoursAgo":1160,"justNow":1161,"minutesAgo":1162,"monthsAgo":1163,"oneDayAgo":1164,"oneHourAgo":1165,"oneMinuteAgo":1166,"oneMonthAgo":1167,"oneYearAgo":1168,"yearsAgo":1169},"{num} days ago","{num} hours ago","Just Now","{num} minutes ago","{num} months ago","1 day ago","1 hour ago","1 minute ago","1 month ago","1 year ago","{num} years ago",{"copied":1171,"documDeletSucce":1172,"noDesc":1173,"selectedItem":1174,"setSuccess":1175,"verified":1176},"Copied！","File successfully deleted","No description","Selected item","Successfully","Verified","Tips",{"attention":1179},"Follow",{"confirm":1181,"subTitle":1182,"subTitleDesc":1183,"title":1184},"Complete. Start Now","Customize Your Domain","Complete your preferences in one minute for priority access to 100,000+ developer projects","Personalized Experience in GitCode Community",{"components":1186,"harmonyModal":1256,"header":1261,"notice":1269,"permissionUpd